# Google Ads credentials — developer token, client secret, refresh token, and
# any recorded API traffic or audit trail. Nothing matching these is in the
# repo today and the intent is that creds stay OUT of the tree entirely, in
# env vars. These patterns plus the pre-commit hook are the belt-and-suspenders
# for the session that first wires real auth.
google-ads.yaml
test.yaml
*.jsonl
audit.jsonl
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials.yaml
credentials.yml
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
tokens.json
refresh_token*
*.bak

